"""Service content for the 21 services in the MyGovt catalogue.

Official evidence: the Tamil Nadu e-Sevai Service List (https://www.tnesevai.tn.gov.in/Pages/ServiceList.aspx, 'Last Updated: 10/04/2023'),
read on 2026-10-20. Each service that has a row there (`row`) takes its stipulated timeline, fees and document list from that row.
The list is three and a half years old, so every fee and timeline is labelled 'per the e-Sevai service list updated 10 Apr 2023'.
Services without a row keep their descriptive text from the project reference (not official) and show the 'could not be verified' notice.

The column after 'Fee' in the official table is read as the e-Sevai service-centre charge (rupees), matching the project reference.
"""
LIST_URL = "https://www.tnesevai.tn.gov.in/Pages/ServiceList.aspx"
PORTAL = "https://www.tnesevai.tn.gov.in/"
REV = "Revenue Administration"


